    "Commuters from further away often use the metro from the Eixample, Gràcia or Sants, or Rodalies to Clot. Driving is possible, but parking is limited and traffic on the Ronda del Litoral can be heavy. Several of the district's larger employers run flexible or hybrid working, so the rush-hour crush on the Poblenou-bound metro is lighter on Mondays and Fridays than midweek.",
